<</Next 457 0 R/Parent 455 0 R/Title(The year 2025 was a year of profound connection and growth for the Pluripotent Foundation. Driven by the belief that geographical boundaries should not limit a child's potential, we successfully utilized online platforms to bridge the gap between underserved students and experienced professionals.)>>
