472 0 obj
<</Parent 471 0 R/Title(Reaching students in remote districts brings the inherent challenge of digital literacy and adapting to online communication. Since our model relies on internet connectivity and Zoom, ensuring students could effectively use these tools was a top priority. Solution: We proactively turned this hurdle into an opportunity by introducing "Basic IT Learning Sessions" directly into our programming, teaching mentees how to navigate the digital world and leverage modern educational tools to their advantage.)>>
endobj

